# Time2EQ control of the example event: exact P and S arrival times at the six stations
# from the hypocenter below, computed on the same travel-time grids yanll uses, so that
# yanll-locate must recover it. scripts/make-example-event.sh appends the EQFILES line
# (time grid root, output file), runs Time2EQ and turns the output into event/event.json;
# the origin time of the event is 2026-01-01T00:00:00Z by that script's convention.
CONTROL 1 54321
TRANS SIMPLE 45.0 10.0 0.0
EQMODE SRCE_TO_STA
# EQSRCE label LATLON latitude longitude depth_km elevation_km
EQSRCE EXAMPLE LATLON 45.05 10.08 8.0 0.0
# EQSTA station phase errorType error reportType report: no noise, pick class 0
EQSTA ST01 P GAU 0.0 QUAL 0
EQSTA ST01 S GAU 0.0 QUAL 0
EQSTA ST02 P GAU 0.0 QUAL 0
EQSTA ST02 S GAU 0.0 QUAL 0
EQSTA ST03 P GAU 0.0 QUAL 0
EQSTA ST03 S GAU 0.0 QUAL 0
EQSTA ST04 P GAU 0.0 QUAL 0
EQSTA ST04 S GAU 0.0 QUAL 0
EQSTA ST05 P GAU 0.0 QUAL 0
EQSTA ST05 S GAU 0.0 QUAL 0
EQSTA ST06 P GAU 0.0 QUAL 0
EQSTA ST06 S GAU 0.0 QUAL 0
EQQUAL2ERR 0.05 0.1 0.2 0.5 99999.9
